  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Welcome to the EDGYLABS Affiliate Program!</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">EDGYLABS is a premium skincare brand inspired by simple, effective ingredients that help nourish and protect the skin. Our products are handcrafted in small batches using high quality beef tallow, botanical oils, butters, and vitamins to support healthy looking skin without unnecessary fillers.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">We focus on clean formulas, beautiful packaging, and creating products that people genuinely love to repurchase.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">Why promote EDGYLABS?</span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\"><br>• High customer satisfaction and repeat purchases.<br>• Unique products that stand out from traditional skincare brands.<br>• Fast shipping from the United States.<br>• Professional product photos and videos available for affiliates.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">How affiliates earn</span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\"><br>Earn a commission on every qualifying sale generated through your unique affiliate link. The more you share, the more you earn.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT';font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">How to promote us</span><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\"><br>Share your honest experience on TikTok, Instagram, YouTube, Facebook, or your blog. Educational skincare content, tutorials, before &amp; after results, and unboxing videos perform especially well.</span></p><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 12px 0px;font:12px 'Times New Roman';\"><span style=\"font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;font-size:12px;\">We look forward to growing together. Welcome to the EDGYLABS family!</span></p></div>",
